============================================================
.gitignore — for jay's monochrome portfolio repo
rule #1: ignore the junk
rule #2: never ignore index.html (it IS the portfolio)
rule #3: snacks cannot be ignored, only consumed
============================================================

---------- OS JUNK (the computer's own bugs) ----------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:alternate
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

---------- EDITOR / IDE JUNK ----------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.history/
*.code-workspace

---------- NODE / NPM (if you ever run netlify-cli etc.) ----------
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml
.npm/
.npmrc

---------- ENV / SECRETS (the eyes see everything. github shouldn't) ----------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets/

---------- BUILD / CACHE JUNK ----------
dist/
build/
.cache/
.tmp/
.tmp*/
out/
coverage/
.nyc_output/
*.tsbuildinfo

---------- NETLIFY / VERCEL LOCAL JUNK ----------
.netlify/
.netlify/
.netlify-state.json
.netlify/
netlify.toml.bak
.vercel/
.netlify/

---------- LOGS / CRASH DUMPS (my bugs' memoirs) ----------
logs/
*.log
*.crash
dump.rdb
nohup.out

---------- ARCHIVES / BACKUPS (future-me's problems) ----------
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.rar
*.7z
backup/
backups/
*-old/
*-copy/
*_copy/
*.bak

---------- PYTHON (bio student side-quests) ----------
pycache/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

---------- MISC ----------
*.orig
*.rej
.cache-loader
.eslintcache
.stylelintcache
.DS_Store

---------- THE SACRED (do NOT ignore, ever) ----------
!index.html
!README.md
!.github/

---------- EMOTIONAL ----------
light mode configs (we don't do that here)
my ex's number
the will to debug css at 3am (already lost, nothing to ignore)
